---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Ira Hospitality collects, uses and protects your personal information." headerTheme="light" label="Privacy Policy">
  <PageHero crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]}>
    Privacy <span class="light">Policy</span>
    <Fragment slot="lead">Great experiences begin with trust, and that extends beyond the brands we build.</Fragment>
  </PageHero>
  <section class="section theme-light" data-theme-section="light" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p>At Ira Hospitality, we believe that great experiences begin with trust—and that extends beyond the brands we build. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you interact with our website or get in touch with us.</p>
        <p>We respect your privacy, and we’re committed to treating your data with care.</p>
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you visit our website, we may collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span><strong>Personal Information</strong> you voluntarily provide: Name, Email address, Phone number</span></li>
          <li>Company name, Any other details you share via our contact or inquiry forms</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We collect and use your information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to project inquiries or service requests</li>
          <li>Understand how users interact with our website</li>
          <li>Improve our site’s content, flow, and experience</li>
          <li>Send occasional updates (only with your consent)</li>
          <li>Maintain internal records and ensure smooth communication</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>3. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
        <p>Our site may use cookies to improve user experience and track usage patterns. You can adjust your browser settings to decline cookies at any time.</p>
        <h2>4. Third-Party Tools</h2>
        <p>We may use third-party tools like Google Analytics to better understand our audience. These platforms may collect certain information in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p>
        <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable technical and organizational precautions to prevent the loss, misuse, or alteration of your personal data. While no digital platform is 100% secure, we aim to implement best practices to keep your information safe.</p>
        <h2>6. Policy Updates</h2>
        <p>This Privacy Policy may be revised from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page, and the date of the last update will be clearly listed.</p>
        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Have questions or concerns? We’d love to hear from you, write to us at <a href={`mailto:${site.policyEmail}`}>{site.policyEmail}</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
